# Implementation plan — Spec 1.13.3

## Summary

Persist the post-login **Choose account** selection for the WebOnOne auth session so page refresh does **not** reopen the dialog. Fill **Settings → Basic Settings** with **Account** (show selected account + Change) and **Theme** (Appearance Light/Dark selectable cards). Reuse session-role reissue and preferences `colorMode`. Remove duplicate color-mode control from System Theme.

See [02-account-selection-persistence.md](./02-account-selection-persistence.md), [03-basic-settings-page.md](./03-basic-settings-page.md), [04-account-tab.md](./04-account-tab.md), [05-theme-tab-appearance.md](./05-theme-tab-appearance.md).

