## Phase 1 — Sticky session selection

**Goal:** Once-per-login dialog; restore on refresh.

**Exit criteria:** Hard refresh after Continue keeps account; no dialog.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Persist / hydrate | `sessionRoleSlice.ts`, auth storage helper or sibling key next to `webonone_auth` |
| Reset on login/logout | `authSlice.ts` / listeners coupling to `sessionRoleActions.reset` |
| Bootstrap | `useSessionRoleBootstrap.ts`, `SessionRoleGate.tsx` — skip dialog when sticky complete |
| Dialog modes | `RoleSelectionDialog.tsx` — gate vs settings (dismissible + pre-select current) |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root`

---

## Phase 2 — Basic Settings Account + Theme

**Goal:** Tabs; Account summary + Change; Appearance cards.

**Exit criteria:** Manual acceptance in 07-implementation-plan.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Page tabs | `features/settings/basic/pages/BasicSettingsPage.tsx` |
| Account panel | New components under `features/settings/basic/` |
| Theme appearance | Light/Dark selectable cards; wire `systemThemeActions.patchPreferencesRequested` |
| System Theme cleanup | `SystemThemePage.tsx` — remove duplicate `ColorModeToggle` |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root`

---

## Forbidden

- Re-opening Choose account on every refresh when selection is already complete
- Skipping first-login dialog only because JWT has `platform_role` (Identity may default Super Admin)
- Persisting selection past logout / across a new `loginSuccess`
- Non-dismissible dialog when opened from Basic Settings Change
- Moving accent palette CRUD onto Basic Settings
- New Identity APIs or role enums
- Tokens in URLs

---

## Acceptance (quick)

1. Multi-account → choose once → refresh → no dialog.
2. Basic Settings Account shows selection; Change works.
3. Theme tab Light/Dark cards switch appearance.
4. Type-check green.
